-text"},"С 7 до 10. Нужно будет осуществить все рабочие мероприятия, связанные с выездами. После чего приступить к вопросу заведения клиентской заявки. Перед этим надо Пообщаться с клиентом Уточнить, что там по итогу-то Выиграли, не выиграли Да"]]],["DIV",{"class":"flex items-center gap-1.5 flex-wrap pl-[26px]"},["SPAN",{"class":"inline-flex items-center gap-1 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded text-[10px] shrink-0 bg-card2 text-sub"},["svg",{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"9","height":"9","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","stroke-width":"1.5","stroke-linecap":"round","stroke-linejoin":"round","class":"lucide lucide-calendar-days","aria-hidden":"true"},["path",{"d":"M8 2v3"}],["path",{"d":"M16 2v3"}],["rect",{"x":"3","y":"3","width":"18","height":"18","rx":"2"}],["path",{"d":"M3 9h18"}],["path",{"d":"M8 13h.01"}],["path",{"d":"M12 13h.01"}],["path",{"d":"M16 13h.01"}],["path",{"d":"M8 17h.01"}],["path",{"d":"M12 17h.01"}],["path",{"d":"M16 17h.01"}]],"19 авг"]]]]],["DIV",{},["BUTTON",{"class":"tap-row w-full text-left bg-card rounded-xl px-3 pb-3 pt-2 flex items-stretch gap-1 "},["DIV",{"role":"button","tabindex":"0","aria-disabled":"false","aria-roledescription":"sortable","aria-describedby":"DndDescribedBy-0","class":"touch-none shrink-0 -my-3 -ml-3 mr-1 px-2 flex items-center justify-center self-stretch text-dim active:text-sub","aria-label":"Перетащить задачу"},["svg",{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"14","height":"14","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","stroke-width":"1.5","stroke-linecap":"round","stroke-linejoin":"round","class":"lucide lucide-grip-vertical","aria-hidden":"true"},["circle",{"cx":"9","cy":"12","r":"1"}],["circle",{"cx":"9","cy":"5","r":"1"}],["circle",{"cx":"9","cy":"19","r":"1"}],["circle",{"cx":"15","cy":"12","r":"1"}],["circle",{"cx":"15","cy":"5","r":"1"}],["circle",{"cx":"15","cy":"19","r":"1"}]]],["DIV",{"class":"min-w-0 flex-1 flex flex-col gap-1"},["DIV",{"class":"flex it